[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0000","text":"电台主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0010","text":"───今天的嘉宾是SHHis的两位——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0001","text":"电台主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0020","text":"欢迎下次再来玩哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0030","text":"谢谢！／非常感谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0040","text":"……啊，那个，美琴小姐────\n接下来的训练，是直接过去吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0050","text":"嗯\n我是这么打算的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0060","text":"啊，这样啊……\n那我也────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0070","text":"我的答案马上就能说出来……但那个算不算\n“想要抵达的地方”，我再好好想想"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0080","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0090","text":"啊，不────没什么……\n没什么事……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0100","text":"是吗\n那走吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0110","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0120","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0130","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0140","text":"那边那个人……\n是Fuwachisu吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0150","text":"诶……\n您知道她们吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0160","text":"嗯\n之前在电视上看到过"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0170","text":"出道30周年还能重组，真厉害啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0180","text":"啊——\n哈哈，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0190","text":"我去打个招呼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_02_0200","text":"诶……\n等、等一下，美琴小姐────"}]
